            <summary><h3>Does the Horizon 7.4 AT work with Peloton and Zwift?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              Horizon's page says it works with Peloton, Zwift, Kinomap, STUDIO and other apps, using Bluetooth and the included chest strap. You stream classes on your own device; there is no built-in subscription.
            </p>
